:"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and October to November came in under 90% of normal in 35 of 75 years, more than any other pair. In 2025 on the middle of the grids, May to June hit 189% of normal and November to December fell to 48%. Grid 16670 had its driest year in 2007 at 60%. On grid 16969, the preliminary estimate for August to September 2026 sits at 45.0.</p>"}
